# Normalise line endings to LF regardless of a contributor's global
# core.autocrlf. Without this, Windows with autocrlf=true checks files out
# as CRLF while prettier's own config (.prettierrc.json: endOfLine: "lf")
# demands LF, and `npm run format:check` flags every touched file as
# "needs formatting" even though nothing about its content actually
# changed - which is exactly what happened here (142 files, zero real
# diffs once renormalised).
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
